WEBVTT

00:02.040 --> 00:03.500
The Great Witch reveals

00:03.500 --> 00:07.040
that the potential to bring about a
great calamity is hidden inside of Helck,

00:07.040 --> 00:09.290
warning Vermilio to be careful.

00:09.750 --> 00:13.630
Helck and Vermilio depart the island
to make their way back to the continent,

00:13.630 --> 00:17.210
but they soon find themselves
under attack by a giant sea creature.

00:17.750 --> 00:21.210
Curse that infernal monster!
It must have followed us here!

00:21.790 --> 00:23.130
I've got this.

00:49.420 --> 00:51.670
A crazed cog in the machine

00:51.670 --> 00:54.330
Lets loose a shrill cry

00:54.330 --> 00:56.330
Destined for battle and foaming at the mouth

00:56.330 --> 00:59.170
As if waiting for an opening

00:59.420 --> 01:01.500
I got dealt a dangerous card

01:01.500 --> 01:04.170
But prediciments are opportunities

01:04.170 --> 01:06.080
There's no way in hell I'm giving up

01:06.080 --> 01:08.960
The last one standing is the winner

01:09.170 --> 01:11.330
Let's just dance hand in hand

01:11.330 --> 01:14.080
With the grinning devil

01:14.080 --> 01:16.330
No need to care about appearances

01:16.330 --> 01:18.670
Courage trembles with fury

01:18.670 --> 01:21.630
Before the darkness can consume it all

01:21.830 --> 01:22.500
Break it

01:22.500 --> 01:24.000
Kick it away

01:24.000 --> 01:27.080
It's your common sense that'll be smashed to bits

01:27.080 --> 01:31.580
Ignite a flame in the soul that no one can extinguish

01:31.880 --> 01:37.290
This prayer that I now offer to the endless world

01:37.290 --> 01:42.040
Will never stop until the day comes when it gets answered

01:42.040 --> 01:43.670
Always burning

01:43.670 --> 01:46.580
It's my soul

01:54.040 --> 01:58.960
<b>Barbarians of the Tothman Tribe</b>

02:05.250 --> 02:07.540
Damn! It'll sink us sooner or later!

02:07.540 --> 02:08.540
I've got this!

02:09.080 --> 02:11.040
No, you don't! Stop it!

02:11.040 --> 02:12.790
I already know you're
gonna throw yourself at-

02:12.790 --> 02:13.500
Hey!

02:17.000 --> 02:19.420
There's nowhere for you to go
but in the whirlpool, dammit!

02:19.420 --> 02:21.420
Did you even think about what comes next?!

02:22.170 --> 02:23.210
SEE!

02:27.540 --> 02:29.920
It actually survived
taking a hit from Helck?!

02:30.380 --> 02:34.000
Then I'm guessing that its body
must be resistant to physical attacks!

02:46.380 --> 02:48.670
Could my magic be enough to take it down?

02:48.670 --> 02:51.420
But if I stop using it to
power the ship's propulsion,

02:51.420 --> 02:53.290
then we'll get sucked into the whirlpool!

02:53.960 --> 02:56.170
Whatever! I have to do something!

02:56.170 --> 02:57.330
It's okay!

02:58.040 --> 02:59.580
Don't worry about me!

02:59.580 --> 03:01.500
Use this chance to escape!

03:01.500 --> 03:02.920
Have you lost your mind?!

03:02.920 --> 03:05.500
Even if you beat it,
you'll just fall into the whirlpool!

03:29.250 --> 03:30.170
Okay.

03:30.170 --> 03:32.540
I shouldn't have to worry about
the whirlpool at this distance.

03:32.540 --> 03:33.670
Now I just wait...

03:33.670 --> 03:37.170
and then zoom back over to rescue Helck
after he beats that thing.

03:42.380 --> 03:43.790
What are you doing?!

03:53.580 --> 03:55.830
It's diving underwater!
Get out of there!

04:04.920 --> 04:07.380
Hey! Hurry and get up here!

04:12.750 --> 04:15.460
There's no way.
He's not dead, is he?

04:16.710 --> 04:18.000
Helck!

04:19.080 --> 04:20.380
Helck!

04:23.960 --> 04:26.830
HELCK!

04:54.170 --> 04:57.380
We only had a little further to go...

04:57.670 --> 05:01.290
The continent is right there.
We could have made it together!

05:15.500 --> 05:16.580
Why?!

05:17.040 --> 05:18.630
Tell me why, Helck!

05:20.080 --> 05:22.670
WHY ARE YOU STANDING HERE
LIKE NOTHING HAPPENED?!

05:22.920 --> 05:24.750
Come on! Cross the finish line!

05:25.670 --> 05:27.500
Helck!

05:29.000 --> 05:31.960
I should have known
that wasn't enough to kill Helck!

05:32.630 --> 05:34.000
I always...

05:34.000 --> 05:35.290
assume the worst!

05:35.500 --> 05:37.250
Piwi! Congratulations!

05:37.880 --> 05:38.710
Cheep!

05:38.710 --> 05:41.000
DON'T START WITH THAT CRAP!
YOU FOOLS!

05:42.000 --> 05:43.460
Whoa, awesome!
Ouch! That's hot!<b></b>

05:43.460 --> 05:45.040
Listen here, you!

05:45.040 --> 05:46.670
You should've returned to the ship
if you were okay!

05:46.670 --> 05:48.670
Why'd you come ashore ahead of us?!

05:49.170 --> 05:50.210
Sorry.

05:50.880 --> 05:55.250
I got sucked up into the whirlpool
after I fended off that monster.

05:55.580 --> 05:58.130
So I swam the best I could to try and escape it,

05:58.130 --> 06:00.540
and then ended up here.

06:01.380 --> 06:04.540
This is why I warned you being at sea
was nothing like being on land!

06:04.540 --> 06:06.670
Stay underwater too long
and you'll die from a lack of air!

06:06.670 --> 06:08.500
Yeah! It felt like my lungs were on fire!

06:08.500 --> 06:09.580
NO DUH!

06:09.580 --> 06:11.630
Think before you act next time, dammit!

06:14.880 --> 06:17.000
It's all right, Anne.

06:17.000 --> 06:18.130
Hm?

06:18.290 --> 06:21.080
I still have a mission
that I need to accomplish.

06:21.080 --> 06:23.960
So I would never
just let myself die out here.

06:25.920 --> 06:27.250
That's great and all,

06:27.250 --> 06:30.880
but you can't expect to overcome every
obstacle in the world with spirit and spunk!

06:31.250 --> 06:33.080
W-well, maybe so...

06:33.080 --> 06:36.880
Not to mention, you really need to be
more considerate of your traveling companions!

06:36.880 --> 06:37.920
Just look!

06:37.920 --> 06:40.250
Piwi's face is full of nothing but concern!

06:47.290 --> 06:48.460
My apologies.

06:49.290 --> 06:52.630
Well, I do appreciate
you risking your life for us.

06:52.960 --> 06:56.960
But next time, you're banned
from making any solo moves, got it?

06:56.960 --> 06:58.790
Discussion over!

06:58.790 --> 07:01.040
Now we need to get ready
and roll out on the double!

07:01.040 --> 07:02.250
Annie!

07:03.710 --> 07:05.920
You haven't crossed the finish line yet!

07:12.960 --> 07:14.380
Anne! Congratulations!

07:14.380 --> 07:15.330
Yay!

07:19.630 --> 07:22.130
What are you doing?!
Hurry and get moving!

07:22.460 --> 07:23.290
Right!

07:30.880 --> 07:32.460
Thanks!

07:34.630 --> 07:36.290
So, where are we headed to?

07:37.540 --> 07:39.790
Our first order of business
is finding a village.

07:39.790 --> 07:41.290
We need a map of the nearby area.

07:46.920 --> 07:48.540
I sense a presence.

07:50.420 --> 07:53.000
But I've seen this ruse play out before.

07:53.000 --> 07:53.960
Helck!

07:53.960 --> 07:56.790
I can tell that this is just
another one of your stupid tricks!

07:56.790 --> 07:57.790
Huh?

08:00.500 --> 08:01.670
Ow, hot!

08:01.670 --> 08:03.170
M-my bad.

08:04.880 --> 08:06.460
Trust me when I say...

08:07.580 --> 08:08.880
it's not me this time!

08:09.290 --> 08:10.790
Yeah, it seems so.

08:11.130 --> 08:13.920
Who goes there?! Show yourself!

08:17.500 --> 08:19.880
We have you surrounded!

08:20.380 --> 08:24.040
Just come along quietly
if you value your lives!

08:24.330 --> 08:26.920
Barbarians who reside in this area, perhaps?

08:26.920 --> 08:29.000
But they seem awfully weak
for that to be the case.

08:29.130 --> 08:31.250
Good. No fast moves now.

08:31.250 --> 08:34.000
We won't do anything to you
as long as you comply.

08:34.000 --> 08:37.540
Actually, I would say they look like
they're on the verge of chickening out...

08:43.460 --> 08:44.960
Hello there!

08:45.250 --> 08:47.630
H-hello there...

08:48.080 --> 08:50.710
These guys want us to go with them.
What do think?

08:50.710 --> 08:54.170
We might be able to get our hands on a map.
Let's follow them.

08:54.540 --> 08:57.670
O-okay. Well, put the shackles on them...

08:58.380 --> 09:00.000
Made of wood, seriously?

09:00.210 --> 09:02.920
Do you really think these are
going to be enough to hold us?

09:02.920 --> 09:05.670
They're all we've got. I'm sorry.

09:05.670 --> 09:08.880
Don't be!
I think these shackles seem pretty sturdy!

09:10.790 --> 09:12.380
Where's mine?

09:13.960 --> 09:16.920
W-well, you don't need any...

09:21.330 --> 09:23.210
And that upsets you why, exactly?

09:24.000 --> 09:26.460
N-now, come with us!

09:58.880 --> 10:01.460
Both the buildings and people
around here are in rough shape.

10:01.460 --> 10:03.460
Everyone is dead in the eyes.

10:05.670 --> 10:08.170
Things weren't always like this.

10:08.170 --> 10:12.040
Although a small kingdom,
this place used to be thriving and peaceful.

10:12.880 --> 10:14.080
But then...

10:14.080 --> 10:17.250
the barbarians of the
Tothman Tribe ruined everything.

10:17.920 --> 10:19.210
Was there a war?

10:19.210 --> 10:20.210
Yes.

10:21.130 --> 10:23.250
There were only 50 of them.

10:23.630 --> 10:25.330
The entire Kingdom of Erille

10:25.330 --> 10:29.250
was brought down by a tiny tribe
consisting of no more than 50 barbarians.

10:30.330 --> 10:32.000
Only 50, you say?

10:32.290 --> 10:34.250
Their people must be
remarkably strong, then.

10:34.250 --> 10:35.330
No.

10:36.250 --> 10:37.580
Up until the war,

10:37.580 --> 10:40.580
the Tothman Tribe were hardly a threat
to us because of their small numbers

10:40.580 --> 10:42.630
and utter lack of leadership.

10:43.880 --> 10:46.920
So then, did an outside power
help them or something?

10:46.920 --> 10:48.670
No, nothing like that.

10:49.040 --> 10:52.830
The members of the Tothman Tribe
just suddenly powered up.

10:54.290 --> 10:58.420
And not only that, the Tothman King
had power that was in a league of its own.

10:58.750 --> 10:59.920
Really?

10:59.920 --> 11:04.250
This place has been a living hell
ever since the Tothman Tribe took over.

11:04.420 --> 11:05.790
To keep us from escaping,

11:05.790 --> 11:08.290
they used a curse that gave
us these monstrous bodies,

11:08.290 --> 11:11.960
and no matter how we're treated,
they show no mercy for anyone who disobeys.

11:12.330 --> 11:14.500
They forced us into doing heavy labor,

11:14.500 --> 11:17.290
and punish those that don't meet the quota

11:17.290 --> 11:21.670
by making them find unwitting people
to become slaves to the Tothman Tribe.

11:21.880 --> 11:23.290
Now I understand.

11:23.290 --> 11:25.170
That's why we were captured.

11:25.170 --> 11:28.250
So you can offer us as slaves
to the barbarians.

11:29.000 --> 11:30.330
How despicable.

11:30.790 --> 11:32.330
Yes.

11:32.330 --> 11:35.250
We know that what we're doing is wrong.

11:35.250 --> 11:39.460
But... we don't want to lose
anymore of our friends!

11:39.460 --> 11:40.790
It's too much!

11:46.790 --> 11:48.580
What do think you're doing?

11:51.250 --> 11:53.670
Y-Your Highness!

11:54.500 --> 11:56.290
Who are these people?

11:57.960 --> 11:59.790
Explain yourselves right this instant!

12:00.170 --> 12:01.880
This better not be what I think it is!

12:01.880 --> 12:03.210
W-well, you see...

12:04.540 --> 12:07.210
There is no Erillean I know
who would stand for such atrocities!

12:07.210 --> 12:11.000
Have you become Tothman barbarians
in heart and soul?!

12:12.920 --> 12:15.670
M-my sincerest apologies...

12:16.460 --> 12:19.790
I'm touched that you would care
so deeply for your fellow Erilleans.

12:19.790 --> 12:22.580
But if our survival comes
at the cost of sacrificing

12:22.580 --> 12:24.580
innocent members of other races,

12:24.580 --> 12:28.170
then I think we're better off
just gallantly facing our deaths.

12:30.670 --> 12:32.380
Now, undo their shackles.

12:32.830 --> 12:34.040
Yes, Your Highness.

12:37.080 --> 12:40.290
Dear adventurers,
we may be in desperate times,

12:40.290 --> 12:42.540
but I must apologize for
the discourtesy of my people.

12:42.540 --> 12:45.170
I truly don't know how
we can make it up to you.

12:46.000 --> 12:47.960
Please forgive them.

12:47.960 --> 12:50.710
Oh, it's fine. Don't worry about it.

12:53.130 --> 12:55.040
What is that sound?

12:56.080 --> 12:57.210
Oh, no!

12:57.210 --> 12:58.290
Your Highness!

13:18.250 --> 13:21.330
It's the Tothman King!
The Tothman King is coming!

13:21.330 --> 13:22.170
No way!

13:22.170 --> 13:25.130
We were supposed to have five days left
before they came back!

13:25.250 --> 13:27.170
You'll be doomed if they find you here!

13:27.170 --> 13:29.210
Please hurry and flee from the rear gate!

13:46.960 --> 13:49.460
G-greetings, Tothman King.

13:49.460 --> 13:51.250
What is it that can we do for you toda-

13:51.250 --> 13:52.500
I'm bored.

13:56.750 --> 13:58.670
P-Princess!

13:58.670 --> 13:59.920
Hang in there!

14:05.170 --> 14:09.420
I've gotten bored with taming
you stupid invertebrates.

14:10.630 --> 14:12.630
There's just no thrill in it.

14:12.630 --> 14:16.460
I want a taste of the same exhilaration I felt
when I brought your kingdom to ruin.

14:16.460 --> 14:19.330
I'm craving that feeling right now.

14:19.540 --> 14:21.130
Conquest is what I need!

14:21.130 --> 14:24.330
The only way to satisfy this craving
is with more conquest!

14:24.580 --> 14:26.540
C-conquest?

14:26.540 --> 14:27.920
Yes!

14:27.920 --> 14:30.670
We seek out other kingdoms
and then crush them!

14:30.670 --> 14:34.670
Never accepting surrender as we continually
rain death and destruction upon them!

14:34.670 --> 14:36.330
That's where the thrill comes from!

14:36.330 --> 14:38.540
Which is why your people
will serve as soldiers

14:38.540 --> 14:40.460
in my conquest army starting right now!

14:40.920 --> 14:42.920
B-but that's not what we agreed upon!

14:42.920 --> 14:46.130
You promised that our lives
would be spared if we surrendered to you!

14:46.290 --> 14:48.960
And that still holds true
as long as you win.

14:48.960 --> 14:53.420
Fight and claim victory on the battlefield
and then you get to keep on living.

14:53.420 --> 14:54.880
Simple, right?

14:54.880 --> 14:56.000
That's impossible.

14:56.000 --> 15:00.170
None of my people have enough
strength left to wage a war at this point.

15:00.170 --> 15:01.880
It just means death for all of us...

15:01.880 --> 15:05.290
That's the deal, Princess.
Make your people get aboard my wagons now!

15:06.000 --> 15:08.250
Please no! I couldn't possibly do that!

15:08.250 --> 15:12.000
Disobey me and I'll just
massacre them all here and now.

15:12.210 --> 15:13.380
Scumbag!

15:13.790 --> 15:15.290
Come on, hurry it up!

15:15.500 --> 15:18.580
You know that I don't have
the patience for this crap!

15:18.790 --> 15:19.920
Do it!

15:24.580 --> 15:25.750
Huh?

15:29.540 --> 15:30.880
You need to stop.

15:31.210 --> 15:33.790
You're not from the Erille Kingdom, are ya?

15:37.130 --> 15:38.420
I said you need to stop.

15:40.420 --> 15:41.420
What the?!

15:41.420 --> 15:45.000
D-did he really just send a Tothman soldier
flying with a slap?!

15:47.130 --> 15:49.250
They have a spellcaster, eh?

15:49.710 --> 15:53.170
It's typically not a good idea to meddle
in the affairs of other countries,

15:53.170 --> 15:55.790
but I can't just disregard what you said.

15:56.630 --> 15:58.500
I'll keep the Erillean people safe.

15:58.500 --> 16:01.630
So you pull out all the stops
and go teach them a lesson.

16:03.000 --> 16:04.250
Roger that.

16:04.670 --> 16:05.500
Oh?

16:05.500 --> 16:09.330
I'll give you some credit for having the
balls to stand up to the Tothman Tribe!

16:09.330 --> 16:12.500
Everyone attack him at once!
I don't care if you kill the bastard!

16:14.210 --> 16:16.000
P-please run away!

16:16.000 --> 16:18.290
The Tothman Tribe
is more powerful than you think!

16:32.170 --> 16:34.080
H-he's so strong...

16:38.080 --> 16:40.580
A-and she's just as strong!

16:40.580 --> 16:42.080
I don't believe this.

16:42.080 --> 16:45.750
A whole squadron of our soldiers was
no match for one Tothman barbarian,

16:45.750 --> 16:47.210
but these two...

16:48.920 --> 16:50.130
Friggin' hell.

16:50.130 --> 16:52.130
Bunch of worthless soldiers.

16:52.380 --> 16:55.960
Looks like I'm gonna have to show them
how to give a proper thrashing!

17:02.290 --> 17:03.960
That's one bug squashed!

17:12.670 --> 17:15.080
Aw yeah, that's the stuff.

17:15.580 --> 17:17.540
Combat is really what I need!

17:17.540 --> 17:21.170
I just don't feel alive unless
I'm punching a hole through someone!

17:22.170 --> 17:23.790
I-it's hopeless...

17:23.790 --> 17:26.540
Their king is on an
entirely different level than the rest.

17:26.540 --> 17:27.630
Well, now.

17:27.630 --> 17:30.460
Don't see many of your kind
around these parts.

17:32.170 --> 17:34.670
I just had a really good idea.

17:35.080 --> 17:36.250
Hey, little girlie!

17:36.250 --> 17:39.330
The first kingdom that I set out to destroy
will be wherever you call home!

17:39.330 --> 17:42.250
Now tell me!
Where can I find it?

17:42.670 --> 17:45.880
Spill the beans and I'll let you live.

17:45.880 --> 17:48.290
Or would you prefer
to use that magic of yours

17:48.290 --> 17:51.250
to fight against the power of my Tothman Tribe?

17:52.960 --> 17:54.210
Here's the deal.

17:54.210 --> 17:58.540
If you really have defeated Helck,
then I'll gladly fight you myself.

17:59.080 --> 18:00.130
What?

18:00.460 --> 18:04.460
But I already know that a worm like you
could never beat Helck.

18:06.000 --> 18:07.670
You must be dreaming, girlie!

18:07.670 --> 18:10.710
That chump who was with you
is already long dea-

18:10.710 --> 18:11.540
Huh?

18:12.420 --> 18:13.460
What?!

18:13.750 --> 18:15.630
How are you still alive?!

18:16.130 --> 18:17.380
I guess it's true.

18:18.130 --> 18:21.830
Humans aren't the only race
with evil assholes like you.

18:22.210 --> 18:23.540
What a shame.

18:23.540 --> 18:24.880
Impossible!

18:24.880 --> 18:27.080
There's no way anybody
could still be breathing

18:27.080 --> 18:29.250
after taking the full force
of my killer punch!

18:29.670 --> 18:31.670
You can hit me with a hundred of them.

18:31.670 --> 18:34.080
It still wouldn't be enough
to take me down.

18:34.790 --> 18:36.330
You're full of shit.

18:36.580 --> 18:39.420
Actually, I'm pretty sure
that's not a bluff.

18:39.830 --> 18:42.040
Fine then!
Let's just see you withstand this!

18:42.040 --> 18:44.790
A barrage of my killer punches
at maximum power!

18:45.290 --> 18:46.880
NOW DIE!

18:57.000 --> 18:58.670
That killed him for sure.

19:00.130 --> 19:01.080
What?!

19:06.170 --> 19:09.080
Is that it? Are you done?

19:11.170 --> 19:12.420
All right.

19:12.420 --> 19:13.960
Time to rough you up.

19:24.380 --> 19:25.710
I win.

19:25.710 --> 19:27.880
H-he really did it...

19:30.080 --> 19:32.040
With just one hit, huh?

19:32.040 --> 19:33.830
Helck is seriously powerful.

19:35.750 --> 19:37.330
He's still conscious after that?

19:38.580 --> 19:41.750
I held back just enough
to make sure you wouldn't pass out.

19:43.420 --> 19:46.710
Now you're going free the Erilleans
from the curse you put on them.

19:46.710 --> 19:48.380
Then leave this place,

19:48.380 --> 19:51.130
and swear on your life
that you'll never show your face again.

19:53.580 --> 19:54.790
Helck...

19:56.290 --> 19:58.290
No way in hell...

19:58.290 --> 20:00.040
I won't accept it...

20:00.500 --> 20:05.500
A stupid chump like this couldn't possibly
have what it takes to defeat me!

20:05.830 --> 20:07.130
Stay down.

20:07.130 --> 20:09.290
It's impossible for you to win.

20:09.750 --> 20:12.960
Keep fighting me
and I guarantee that you'll die.

20:12.960 --> 20:14.130
Die?

20:14.630 --> 20:17.500
You're talking to the Tothman King!

20:17.500 --> 20:18.830
I'm the top of the food chain!

20:19.080 --> 20:23.040
I don't lose to anyone! I stand supreme!

20:23.040 --> 20:25.250
The best of the best!

20:25.750 --> 20:27.170
Something's wrong with him!

20:27.170 --> 20:28.250
I'm the strongest!

20:28.250 --> 20:29.080
What's happening? I feel an ominous aura.
I'm the strongest!<b></b>

20:29.080 --> 20:30.920
What's happening? I feel an ominous aura.
I'm the strongest! I'm the strongest!<b></b>

20:30.920 --> 20:32.040
I'm the strongest! I'm the strongest!

20:32.040 --> 20:33.920
I'm the strongest!

20:34.880 --> 20:39.710
I am... THE STRONGEST!

20:42.420 --> 20:43.250
What?!

20:48.630 --> 20:51.330
Power... Power...

20:51.330 --> 20:54.580
I feel it surging through me!

20:58.920 --> 21:01.130
Wh-what... is he?

21:02.420 --> 21:07.830
So much power...
I'm bursting with power!

21:19.830 --> 21:22.630
I promise you

21:22.630 --> 21:25.580
Someday when the world

21:25.580 --> 21:27.670
Comes to an end

21:27.670 --> 21:30.290
I hope we meet once again

21:42.380 --> 21:47.750
Someone once told me

21:47.750 --> 21:53.670
You were like a flower

21:53.670 --> 21:59.210
In a room without water, yet surely

21:59.210 --> 22:01.710
Blooming towards tomorrow

22:03.420 --> 22:06.210
If it was all a dream

22:06.210 --> 22:09.080
To know you

22:09.080 --> 22:12.000
To be in love

22:12.000 --> 22:15.500
I wouldn't know the meaning of life

22:16.330 --> 22:19.130
Even if tomorrow

22:19.130 --> 22:21.830
The rain pours

22:21.830 --> 22:24.210
Dawn will come and

22:24.210 --> 22:27.290
Rainbows will arch over the world

22:27.670 --> 22:30.380
The pain in my heart

22:30.380 --> 22:33.250
The tears trickling down

22:33.250 --> 22:36.710
Let's turn it into seeds for the future

22:36.710 --> 22:38.330
We go on

22:39.040 --> 22:41.080
Until our clumsy love

22:41.080 --> 22:44.250
Blooms into a flower

22:46.040 --> 22:50.830
<b>Next Episode</b>

22:46.040 --> 22:50.830
<b>In Pursuit of a Map</b>

22:46.920 --> 22:49.790
Next time: "In Pursuit of a Map"
